item-content\">\n											<h5>DEDICATED HOURS</h5>\n											<p> Delivered through focused gameplay, optimized routes, and smart in-game decision-making.</p>\n										</div></li>\n								</ul>\n							</div>\n						</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</section>\n	<!-- ===========About Section Ends Here========== -->\n      <!-- Features In start -->\n    <section id=\"features-section\" class=\"padding-bottom\">\n        <div class=\"overlay \">\n            <div class=\"container wow fadeInUp\">\n                <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-10\">\n                        <div class=\"section-header text-center\">\n                            <h2 class=\"title\">  OUR FEATURES</h2>\n                            <p>THE BIGGEST ESPORTS TOURNAMENTS. ANYTIME. ANYWHERE.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row pm-none\">\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n                        <div class=\"single-item text-center\">\n                            <div class=\"img-area\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/images/features-icon-1.png\" alt=\"image\">\n                            </div>\n                            <h5>PRO PLAYER SUPPORT</h5>\n                            <p>Our elite boosters are available 24/7 to guide, assist, and upgrade your in-game journey.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-6\">\n                        <div class=\"single-item text-center\">\n                            <div class=\"img-area\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/images/features-icon-2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n                            </div>\n                            <h5>QUICK PAYOUTS</h5>\n                            <p> Get your rewards instantly after boost completion — sec